# finish/rune: T6 runes on N (STYLE_P2 27.3; P2C_CONTRACTS 3b; LADDER-FINISH, ladder polish i1): the seam keeps its drawn
# step except one 2 px stroke every 12 px on the diagonal ((x + y) mod 12 < 2, one step Glow 2): a quiet mark of writing
# on a seam, never a neon outline nor a spray of cyan specks (the i3 blind panel read i3's 43 % as noise on the chest).
# T6's light lives in the glyph (one shape a piece) and the gems; the runes only hint. Glow cells write their step.
# Generated by LADDER-FINISH's gen_polish.py.
# Alloys i3 (LADDER-FINISH, A2 + A5): the seam is Glow 1 (g: the glow's darkest step, a dark line at the breath's trough that
# the breath lights to near white at its peak: the widest swing a glow pixel has) with a Glow 2 beat every 4th cell along any
# line ((x + 2y) mod 4 == 3: rows, columns and both diagonals all beat; i1's (x + y) mod 12 missed an up-right blade or ray
# whole). The Mythic's sun aegis: its eight N rays now burn as eight dark-ember rays at the trough and blaze at the peak
# (before: 2-4 stray orange specks on a flat orange disc, "fuzzy at game scale"); the T6 blade's fuller breathes end to end.
# Measured: C13 lt6 DRAWN bright 128 (cap 128), lt6m 125, soft 119-156 / 153-239 (cap 320). Generated by tools3/gen_i3.py.
# (FORGE-MARKS forge i1) the beat is (x + 2y) mod 8 < 2: a 2 px dash every 8 along rows, columns and both diagonals (i3's
# mod 4 == 3 never beat a column on an even x: flutes, ribs and splint gaps stayed dark), the same 25 % of the seam lit.
use person
body adult
role overlay finish.rune
legend ! glow 2
legend : glow 3
legend g glow 1
tags tile overlay
on-region N

# (envelope r2, FORGE-MATERIAL; PLAN A5 "no flame, rim, glow, ember or speck pixel in W7's face box + 1 px", C19 A5) the seam
# between the beats keeps its DRAWN step (was g = Glow 1 on every N cell): the ember collar's N cells under the chin and the
# helm's brow seam sat inside the face box + 1 and glowed in every frame (fm_myth D: 2 glow px on the face), and Glow 1 on
# a diagonal seam drew 4-lone glow staircases. The light is now the 2 px beats alone, (x + 2y) mod 8 < 2 as before: the
# rune still breathes along rows, columns and both diagonals; the dark seam reads as the engraving it lights. C13: lt6 /
# lt6m soft light stays over its floor (measured with --doll --gates; no C13 line moved).
# (FINISH wave 2 r3, the judge: C13 "lt6 LOCO 12-39 px of soft light, 40 wanted") the beat is (x + 2y + 5) mod 6 < 3: 3 px
# dashes with 3 px gaps along a row, 2 px dashes with 1 px gaps down a column (a splint gap, a flute), half the seam lit
# (was 25 %). The phase picked by measurement over 18 lattices (r3/rune_search.txt): the only half-lit phase that keeps
# C19 A5 (no glow px in the Mythic's face box, the Mythic 1.15 over its T6) with C13 at its least.
# a written line of light, still no lone pixel on a row or a column.
view D key rest origin 0 0
|.!!!..
|!!...!
|...!!!
|.!!!..
|!!...!
|...!!!

# (FINISH wave 2 r1) the peoples' scripts (the delight: a Legendary's runes in its maker people's own script): keys
# = the motif names; `rest` stays the Heartland's (and every people's until DOLL-C's hook draws `<motif>` first).
# Letters of 2x2 / 2x3 / 3x2 strokes, 2 px apart or more, so a seam lights 2-3 px a letter in a row or a column; a
# Glow 3 nib in the 3 px strokes; 11-18 % of the seam lit (rest 25 %). knot staves and twigs (Fjordfolk, Highland),
# laurel square capitals (Imperial), clouds brush pairs (Jade), arab a trailing hand (Dune), horse paired marks
# (Steppe), reed tallies (Marsh), wave a stepping current (River), ray bursts (Sun Temple), vein a stroke and leaf
# (Sylvan), star points (Starspire). Generated by FINISH's tools/gen_runes.py.

